  "details": "Description\n\nAvatars do not load, and are instead replaced with an \"ERROR\" substitute model. In-world avatar thumbnails also load as \"Avatar not found\".\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nUnsure, I don't believe desktop mode has this issue, but I am not certain of that. Clearing avatar cache does not seem to work either, as it happens even on a low cache.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Avatar\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2p2-1903-5de5614b49-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-28_14-32-43.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_af692a6a-908a-4691-8470-0ec1d6300c8e/1/file)",
